PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E46N23

   1 a 0000 E46N23:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-42/P2c] NEGATIVE: FILE BEFORE.  The mirror of
   4 a 0006      E46N22. */
